{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\"id\":\"S01-1\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S01-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S01-B1-p3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S01-B3-p3\",\"verdict\":\"部分\",\"note\":\"保留了生气与想念之间的难以分辨，但漏掉了遗憾这一可能，也弱化了尚未找到情绪对象、尚未找到语言的失落感。\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S02-3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S02-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S02-B1-p4\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S02-B4-p3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S03-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S03-B2-p4\",\"verdict\":\"部分\",\"note\":\"保留了温柔、心颤和怀念带来的距离感，但将刺痛到绝望弱化成了轻松过后的心酸，情绪强度有所下降。\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S04-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S04-B2-p2\",\"verdict\":\"部分\",\"note\":\"保留了美好回忆也会刺痛，但没有留下关键因果：不是记忆变坏，而是记忆太好，过去已经无法原样回来。\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S05-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S05-B5-p3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S06-1\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S06-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S06-3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S06-B2-p3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S07-3\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S07-1\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S07-B1-p2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S08-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S08-B3-p2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S08-B2-p1\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S09-1\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S09-B2-p2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S10-2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S10-1\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S10-B3-p2\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n    {\"id\":\"S10-B1-p5\",\"verdict\":\"保留\",\"note\":\"\"},\n